{{Quote|Transforms the user into a mammoth, providing strength and size.|Shop}}
'''Mammoth''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,700,000}} or {{Robux|2,350}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].
Mammoth allows the user to transform into an armored {{w|mammoth}}, gaining the ability to unleash red, powerful air slashes and manipulate shadowy force before crushing them with brute strength.

